Patch 2004: the vertex-program path binds all 16 RSX texture units.

The root signature had an SRV table t0-t3 and samplers s0-s3, but the game's fragment programs sample units up to 8, so the shader
compiler failed every such shader and the scene passes never drew. VP_TEX_UNITS (16) now runs end to end: SRV table range, 16
sampler tables in the root signature, tex[16] in the draw record.

